which breaks it down to 80
cents per 100 milliliters.

00:29:56.227 --> 00:29:57.095
So it looks like the UK

00:29:57.095 --> 00:29:58.496
is actually getting a slightly better deal

00:29:58.496 --> 00:29:59.764
